<title>HUNGARY: Hungary six-mth BUBOR edges lower, others steady.</title>
<headline>Hungary six-mth BUBOR edges lower, others steady.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) were steady for the one- and three-month maturities and edged lower for six months, the National Bank of Hungary said on Wednesday on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 21.29 percent and the three-month rate at 21.15 percent, both unchanged, while the six-month rate eased 0.01 percent to 21.01.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
